# Broodspinner: "When this creature enters, surveil 2" (CR 701.25a) puts the Island and the Armageddon under it into Bot1's
# graveyard, both of them (a surveil 1 could not reach the second). "{4}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice this creature: Create a number of 1/1
# black and green Insect creature tokens with flying equal to the number of card types among cards in your graveyard" (CR 111.1,
# 205.2a) is paid exactly by a Black Lotus (GGG) with a Swamp, a Mox Jet and a Mox Emerald, the pool empty after. As it
# resolves Bot1's graveyard holds a Black Lotus (artifact), an Island (land), an Armageddon (sorcery) and the sacrificed
# Broodspinner (creature): four types, four Insects, the Bolt (an instant) in Bot2's graveyard staying out of the count.

